<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着英伟达恢复涨势消退，股市继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-continue-fall-as-nvidia-reinstatement-rally-fades</link><description>乔纳森·费罗（Jonathan Ferro）、丽莎·阿布拉莫维奇（Lisa Abramowicz）和安玛丽·霍登（Annmarie Hordern）每天与华尔街、华盛顿及其他地区的领导人和决策者交谈。没有其他程序比“彭博监控”更能在交易日为投资者和高管提供更好的定位。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-continue-fall-as-nvidia-reinstatement-rally-fades'&gt;随着英伟达恢复涨势消退，股市继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Continue Fall as Nvidia Reinstatement Rally Fades&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-continue-fall-as-nvidia-reinstatement-rally-fades</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:49:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</link><description>科技股的抛售使得投资者迈克尔·伯里(Michael Burry)在抛售以科技股为主的纳斯达克100指数的看跌期权后，他的股票多头头寸多于空头头寸。迈克尔·伯里因2008年做空美国抵押贷款市场而闻名。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts'&gt;迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Michael Burry Is More Long Than Short After Dumping Nasdaq Puts&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Pare AI-Driven Losses as Buyers Step In: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Bounces Off Tech-Driven Lows as Dip Buyers Emerge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据说 GTCR 正在考虑 50B 美元的全球支付收购</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video</link><description>彭博社的孙梦琪与丹尼·伯格一起参加“彭博交易”。 GTCR 在一份文件中证实，它正在探索收购 Global Payments，这将是有史以来规模最大的杠杆收购之一。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video'&gt;据说 GTCR 正在考虑 50B 美元的全球支付收购&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：GTCR Is Said to Weigh $50B Global Payments Buyout&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gtcr-is-said-to-weigh-50b-global-payments-buyout-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:06:17 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>